      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Lock & Unlock Alert",
      "id": "lock-management",
      "intro": "Sistem Lock Management memastikan bahwa sebuah alert hanya dapat diinvestigasi dan ditindaklanjuti oleh satu analis dalam satu waktu, guna mencegah konflik atau duplikasi pekerjaan.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Mekanisme Lock Data",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Saat alert dalam status **Locked**, tindakan perubahan (seperti klasifikasi, action request, assign) akan diblokir bagi pengguna lain.\n• Terdapat dua kepemilikan lock:\n  1. **Mine:** Alert dikunci oleh Anda sendiri. Anda bebas melakukan aksi penuh.\n  2. **Others:** Alert dikunci oleh analis lain. Anda hanya bisa melihat detail (Read-only) dan tidak bisa mengubah atau meng-unlock alert tersebut.",
          "color": "#eab308",
          "bg": "#fefce8",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(234,179,8,.15);border:1px solid #fef08a;background:#fff;padding:16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#f8fafc;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">#12345 - E-Commerce</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;margin-top:4px;\">Locked by: <b>You</b> (admin)</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:4px 10px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:6px;color:#16a34a;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Editable</span></div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#f8fafc;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">#12346 - ATM Withdrawal</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;margin-top:4px;\">Locked by: <b>Analyst_02</b></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:4px 10px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;border-radius:6px;color:#dc2626;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Read-only</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Melakukan Single Lock / Unlock",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Dari Detail Panel:** Buka drawer detail alert. Jika alert belum dilock, klik ikon gembok terbuka (Unlock) untuk melakukan Lock. Jika sudah Anda lock, klik ikon gembok tertutup (Lock) untuk meng-Unlock.\n• Tombol aksi penting lainnya (seperti Add Request / Edit Request) akan otomatis dinonaktifkan (disabled) jika alert tersebut dilock oleh `Others`.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(59,130,246,.15);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:16px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Alert Details</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#64748b;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 9.9-1\"/></svg></button><button style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:6px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#2563eb;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg></button></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Bulk Lock & Bulk Unlock",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Akses menu tindakan lanjutan (titik tiga) di toolbar utama tabel.\n• Pilih **Bulk Lock** untuk mengunci banyak alert sekaligus. Layar akan beralih ke mode seleksi, menyembunyikan alert yang sudah dilock, dan Anda dapat mencentang alert mana saja yang ingin dikunci. Klik `Lock Selected`.\n• Pilih **Bulk Unlock** untuk membuka kunci banyak alert Anda sekaligus. Layar hanya akan menampilkan alert yang sedang Anda lock (`mine`). Centang alert yang diinginkan, lalu klik `Unlock Selected`.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(139,92,246,.15);border:1px solid #ddd6fe;background:#fff;padding:16px;\"><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Lock Mode Active</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#8b5cf6;color:#fff;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Lock Selected (2)</button></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:16px;height:16px;accent-color:#8b5cf6;\"/><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">#12345 - E-Commerce</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:16px;height:16px;accent-color:#8b5cf6;\"/><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">#12346 - E-Commerce</div></div></div></div>"
